			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Espressif ESP32-C5-WROOM-1. Dual-band 2.4/5 GHz Wi-Fi 6 co-processor, attached to the BT840 over SPI and running ESP-Hosted or ESP-AT. It is NOT a host MCU -- it runs the Wi-Fi and TCP/IP stacks itself so the nRF52840 does not have to. Pins transcribed from Espressif ESP32-C5-WROOM-1 & WROOM-1U Datasheet v1.3, Table 3-1. On-board PCB antenna covers both bands, so no diplexer or external antenna is needed. Peak TX 313 mA (2.4 GHz) / 403 mA (5 GHz), Table 6-4/6-5; supply must deliver >=0.6 A, Table 6-2. NOT WiFi 6E -- no 6 GHz -- which keeps it clear of UWB channel 5 at 6489.6 MHz."
			(at 101.6 90.17 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
